WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t1-05-shame-dissolution.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.720
There was a weight in your chest

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.000
Or a sudden heat in your face that makes you want to turn away.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.950
That isn't incidental.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:23.340
Wanting to hide from what you're feeling is most of what this state is.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.650
We'll go slowly.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.780
Nothing here asks you to say anything out loud.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.770
To anyone

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.910
The body goes first.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.810
The part of you that can hold it steady comes second.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.610
Most of the trouble lives in the gap between the two.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.360
Four steps. Four steps.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.560
I'll take you through them.

phase-recognise
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.880
First, we recognise where this is sitting in your body.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.710
Before any of the words attach.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.030
Clinically, shame is a collapse response.

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.020
Notice if your face and neck feel hot.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:22.360
Or if there's a sinking through the chest and a curling in the shoulders.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.340
It is a physical impulse to shrink.

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:30.610
To make yourself invisible before anyone else can turn their gaze on you.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.130
Now describe it in one word.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:38.420
This state arrives with a global verdict attached.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:43.340
presenting itself not as I made a mistake, but as I am the mistake.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:45.810
One layer down.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:49.590
Look gently at the hidden driver powering this collapse.

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:53.540
The protective instinct to condemn yourself first

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:58.780
So that the threat of external rejection or exile cannot catch you and
prepared.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.530
Sink into that core vulnerability.

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:05.070
The terror of being deeply seen.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.690
Found fundamentally defective and cast out.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:12.160
Leave it right where it is, nothing to solve here.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:13.560
Second, second,

phase-regulate
00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:16.390
We regulate your physiology to slow the heart.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.310
Breathe in for six

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:19.750
And out.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:21.910
Even.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.020
Both ways.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.810
Bring your attention to the middle of your chest

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.860
If a hand their helps

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:34.020
Warmth at the chest is one of the few things this state accepts.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.480
Let the shoulders come back a little.

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.120
Not straighten it up.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.960
Just less cold.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.740
That's what a mind

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:46.730
And it doesn't mean this isn't working.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.430
Don't push it away

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:51.880
Don't follow us.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.330
Don't finish us.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.020
A thought turning up isn't asking you to act.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.160
If you notice yourself working hard at this,

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.250
Ease off.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.100
Effort means you've started fighting.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:09.050
Stay here a little longer in this quiet breathing space before we move
forward.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.210
Third.

phase-release
00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:13.500
We release the heavy burden of the court case.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.740
There are two separate things going on right now.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.590
And there's the case being built against you.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.180
Which has been gathering evidence quietly for a while.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.960
Things nobody else remembers.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.520
Things that weren't your fault.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.510
Filed as if they were.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.580
Let the state be here.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:36.830
It arrived.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.620
And it isn't being argued with.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.280
Set down the case

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.110
Only the case.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.920
Whatever real thing may be underneath it stays,

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.770
And you can look at it later.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.260
From somewhere steadier.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:59.901
We pause here to offer deep gratitude to your attention and your heart for
granting you conscious awareness of what has really been driving this stage

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:00.600
from within.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:08.400
The deep concern that your truth and dignity needed continuous protection was
intensely real.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:13.380
And that background vigil has been quietly draining your vital energy.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.870
You can thank that vigilant part of you for trying to keep you safe.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:21.100
And gently let it know it can rest now.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.270
And the question

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:30.140
Not what is wrong with me, you've asked that many times and it only ever
returns more of itself.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.130
What was this for?

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.860
Something in you learn to go small and quiet

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.540
Not a defect

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.020
It's a maneu

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.720
And not being cast out.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:45.460
You don't need the answer now, keep the question.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:49.080
And notice that some of this may be older than today.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.780
You might not want to put it down.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.630
It was built with what you had then.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:58.240
And what you have then isn't what you have now.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.240
You can see a state while you're inside it.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.030
And you did that at the start of this.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:10.440
You're only being asked to notice that the person is guarding.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.890
Isn't the one it started guarding?

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.920
Put that underlined fear where your breath is and leave it there.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.460
Some of it was never yours to control.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.360
Some get answered later.

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:36.640
Why what happens?

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.960
None of it gets settled from inside the state.

phase-rise
00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.190
We rise into quiet self-dignity.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:02.000
Picture yourself from across the room, shoulders forward.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.680
You're having a bad hour with yourself.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:10.180
That's what this is

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:18.490
Now picture the version of you that you'd want to be when this state arrives.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.160
Same verdict

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.240
Same wish to hide

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:32.820
But you're the one deciding where your attention goes.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.380
Not on the verdict.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.050
On something ordinary you're doing in view

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.530
What's in your hands

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.080
Who can see you

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.050
Now step into it.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.290
The verdict may still be there.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.330
Your attention is where you push it.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:09.120
And notice the part of you that kept looking when it was uncomfortable.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.240
That was yours before today.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.700
Afterwards, right down what was different.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.660
One more slow breath.

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.710
Notice how you are now.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.320
Different or not, either is fine.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.690
Move your hands in face

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.340
Feel the floor under you

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.310
Open your eyes when you are ready.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:10.160
Return to this guided meditation as often as you need to until you no longer
do.
